### Storage node down
For 5 minutes one or more storage nodes have reported their storage down. Volumes with replicas on those nodes run degraded or lose quorum.

#### Check first
1. [Cluster metrics](/#/components/{{ componentUrnForUrl }}/metrics) → **Portworx** tab → **Health**.
2. **Storage nodes** (on this page): which node is not OK.
3. `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl status` from any healthy node.

#### Fix
Fix the node (pod, network, disk) as described in *Storage node not OK*.
